# Decrease at the same price keeps time priority: 1 stays at the front.
R 4 1 100 3
# Same price and quantity: a no-op that also keeps priority.
R 5 2 100 5
# Increase at the same price loses priority: 2 moves to the back.
R 6 2 100 7
# A sell for 4 hits the queue front to back: 1 (3), then 3 (1).
N 7 4 4 S LMT GTC 0 CN 100 4
